#: ../developer/routing.md ../developer/routing.md:1
msgid "Routing"
msgstr "路由"

#: ../developer/routing.md:3
msgid ""
"A client asks for one public model id, and the gateway decides which "
"upstream endpoint serves it. It retries on another endpoint when one "
"fails, stops sending traffic to endpoints that are down, and keeps a "
"conversation on the endpoint whose prefix cache is warm."
msgstr ""
"客户端请求一个对外的模型 "
"id，由网关决定哪个上游端点来处理。某个端点失败时，网关会换一个端点重试；它不再向宕机的端点发送流量，并让一段对话留在前缀缓存已经预热的端点上。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:8
msgid ""
"This page covers the routing engine, its settings, how a router executes "
"the endpoint it chose, and how to add a strategy. "
"[Configuration](configuration.md) explains where configuration lives, and"
" [Adding a New Model](adding-models.md) explains a model entry and its "
"`route:` list."
msgstr ""
"本页介绍路由引擎、它的设置项、router "
"如何执行它选中的端点，以及如何添加路由策略。[配置](configuration.md)说明配置保存在哪里，[添加新模型](adding-"
"models.md)说明模型条目及其 `route:` 列表。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:13
msgid "Choosing a router per model"
msgstr "为每个模型选择 router"

#: ../developer/routing.md:15
msgid ""
"The routing file's `default_router:` names the strategy for models that "
"do not choose one. A model entry overrides it:"
msgstr "路由文件中的 `default_router:` 为没有自行选择的模型指定路由策略。模型条目可以覆盖它："

#: ../developer/routing.md:45
msgid "Two strategies are registered:"
msgstr "目前注册了两种策略："

#: ../developer/routing.md:47
msgid ""
"**`fixed`** (the default): weighted random selection with fallback. Its "
"only setting with an effect is `router_params.hybrid_composition` "
"(default `false`), which turns on the experimental [hybrid composition"
"](#hybrid-composition)."
msgstr ""
"**`fixed`**（默认）：按权重随机选择，并自动回退。它唯一有实际作用的设置项是 "
"`router_params.hybrid_composition`（默认 `false`），用于开启实验性的[混合组合](#hybrid-"
"composition)。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:51
msgid ""
"**`routewise`**: cost- and latency-aware selection; see "
"[RouteWise](#routewise)."
msgstr "**`routewise`**：兼顾成本和延迟的选路方式；见 [RouteWise](#routewise)。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:53
msgid ""
"`router_params:` holds the chosen strategy's settings. Admin refuses a "
"catalog whose `router:` names no registered strategy or whose "
"`router_params:` holds a key the strategy does not accept, naming the "
"model and the problem; a stored catalog with either problem registers "
"none of its models at startup and logs the same message. A "
"`default_router` that names no strategy is refused with the known "
"strategies listed. `ENABLE_ROUTEWISE=true` makes `routewise` the default "
"when the routing file leaves `default_router` at `fixed`."
msgstr ""
"`router_params:` 保存所选策略的设置项。如果目录中的 `router:` 指向一个未注册的策略，或者 "
"`router_params:` 中有该策略不接受的键，Admin "
"会拒绝保存，并在消息中指明是哪个模型、出了什么问题；已保存的目录若有上述任一问题，启动时不会注册其中任何模型，并记录同样的消息。`default_router`"
" 指向不存在的策略时也会被拒绝，消息中列出已知的策略。当路由文件把 `default_router` 保留为 `fixed` "
"时，`ENABLE_ROUTEWISE=true` 会把默认策略改为 `routewise`。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:61
msgid ""
"An alias shares its model's router, so a learning router sees the model's"
" and its aliases' traffic together."
msgstr "别名与其模型共用同一个 router，所以会学习的 router 会把模型及其别名的流量放在一起看。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:64
msgid "How `FixedRouter` picks an endpoint"
msgstr "`FixedRouter` 如何挑选端点"

#: ../developer/routing.md:66
msgid ""
"For each request the `fixed` router narrows the model's routes in this "
"order:"
msgstr "每来一个请求，`fixed` router 都按下面的顺序逐步筛选模型的路由："

#: ../developer/routing.md:68
msgid ""
"**Published route.** A model without a published, non-empty route gets a "
"404."
msgstr "**已发布的路由**。没有已发布且非空路由的模型返回 404。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:70
msgid ""
"**Modalities.** A request with non-text input keeps only routes whose "
"`input_modalities` cover it, or raises `AllCircuitsOpenError` naming the "
"modalities."
msgstr ""
"**输入模态**。带有非文本输入的请求只保留 `input_modalities` 覆盖该输入的路由，否则抛出 "
"`AllCircuitsOpenError` 并指明所需的模态。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:73
msgid ""
"**Pin.** `X-Route-Pin: <provider-or-endpoint-id>` on "
"`/v1/chat/completions` selects that route and disables fallback. The "
"gateway honours it only on an administrator's request. A pin that matches"
" nothing raises `ProviderPinError`."
msgstr ""
"**固定路由**。`/v1/chat/completions` 上的 `X-Route-Pin: <provider-or-endpoint-"
"id>` 会直接选中该路由并关闭回退。网关只对管理员的请求采纳它。匹配不到任何路由的 pin 会抛出 `ProviderPinError`。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:77
msgid ""
"**Admission.** Routes with weight `0`, an open circuit or a half-open "
"test request in flight are dropped; if none is left, "
"`AllCircuitsOpenError` names the endpoints considered. The model's "
"offload route is held back unless it is the only one left (see [Queue-"
"wait offload](#queue-wait-offload))."
msgstr ""
"**准入**。权重为 `0`、熔断器打开或已有半开试探请求在途的路由会被排除；如果一条都不剩，`AllCircuitsOpenError` "
"会列出考虑过的端点。模型的卸载路由也会被暂时留出，除非它是唯一剩下的路由（见[排队等待卸载](#queue-wait-offload)）。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:81
msgid ""
"**Affinity.** A live pin for this caller and model wins, unless its "
"endpoint is backlogged (see [Session affinity](#session-affinity))."
msgstr "**会话亲和**。该调用方和模型有有效的亲和绑定时优先使用，除非对应端点积压过多（见[会话亲和](#session-affinity)）。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:83
msgid ""
"**Weighted draw**, biased away from endpoints busy with prefill (see "
"[Prefill-aware selection](#prefill-aware-selection))."
msgstr "**按权重抽取**，并避开正忙于 prefill 的端点（见[prefill 感知的选路](#prefill-aware-selection)）。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:86
msgid "Fallback"
msgstr "回退"

#: ../developer/routing.md:88
msgid ""
"When the selected adapter raises, `FixedRouter` records the failure, "
"drops the caller's affinity pin and tries the remaining routes in "
"declaration order. It skips weight-`0` routes, routes that cannot take "
"the request's modalities, and routes the breaker refuses. The first "
"success answers; if every route fails, the primary error is raised with "
"the attempt list attached. An offload route comes next after a timed-out "
"wait and last otherwise."
msgstr ""
"所选 adapter 抛出异常时，`FixedRouter` 记录这次失败，丢弃调用方的亲和绑定，然后按声明顺序尝试其余路由。它会跳过权重为 "
"`0` "
"的路由、无法接受该请求模态的路由，以及熔断器拒绝的路由。第一个成功的路由给出回答；如果所有路由都失败，就抛出主路由的错误，并附上全部尝试记录。卸载路由在一次等待超时后紧接着尝试，其他情况下排在最后。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:95
msgid "Fallback stops early in four cases:"
msgstr "以下四种情况会提前停止回退："

