#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid ""
"Seconds after one caller's counted failure during which its repeat "
"failures are kept off the circuit, if another caller has been served "
"since. Also how recent another caller's failure must be, unless it is "
"part of the current run of failures, before one caller's failures can "
"open the circuit. `0` stops telling callers apart: every failure counts "
"and any failure can open the circuit."
