" 表示不再区分调用方：每次失败都计入，任何失败都能让熔断器打开。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:147
msgid ""
"`GET /health/deep` shows each endpoint's availability and circuit state, "
"and marks an endpoint degraded as soon as a provider rejects the "
"gateway's own credential. State is per process: each worker keeps its own"
" breakers. The routing file's `health_check:` probe only reports; it "
"never changes routing."
msgstr ""
"`GET /health/deep` 显示每个端点的可用率和熔断状态，并且一旦 provider "
"拒绝网关自己的凭据，就立即把该端点标记为降级。这些状态按进程保存：每个 worker 有自己的熔断器。路由文件的 `health_check:` "
"探测只做报告，从不改变路由。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:152
msgid ""
"**For router authors:** `allow_request(endpoint_id)` is a pure predicate,"
" asked of every candidate. `begin_dispatch(endpoint_id)` is the commit, "
"called once for the chosen endpoint; it returns a `DispatchClaim`, or "
"`None` when the endpoint cannot take the request. Release the claim with "
"`end_dispatch(claim)` in a `finally`, as you release the prefill lease. "
"Only that claim frees a half-open test slot, and it expires after "
"`CIRCUIT_COOLDOWN_SECONDS` if never released."
msgstr ""
"**写 router 的注意事项**：`allow_request(endpoint_id)` "
"是纯判断，会对每个候选调用。`begin_dispatch(endpoint_id)` 是提交，只对选中的端点调用一次；它返回一个 "
"`DispatchClaim`，端点无法接这个请求时返回 `None`。要像释放 prefill 租约一样，在 `finally` 中用 "
"`end_dispatch(claim)` 释放它。只有这个 claim 能释放半开试探的名额；如果一直没有释放，它会在 "
"`CIRCUIT_COOLDOWN_SECONDS` 后过期。"

