#: ../developer/routing.md:175
msgid ""
"`routing_yaml` appears only on a gateway without a database; with one, "
"the routing file's split never reaches the weights. Exclusions are also "
"merged into the `providers` map (`excluded_from_models`, "
"`exclusion_reasons`) and do not degrade the health verdict. A route "
"zeroed at runtime is logged as `route_weight_zeroed` (`WARNING`), and a "
"re-weighted one as `route_weight_overridden` (`INFO`), at boot and after "
"every override reload."
msgstr ""
"`routing_yaml` 只会出现在没有数据库的网关上；有数据库时，路由文件的划分不会影响权重。这些排除项也会合并到 `providers` "
"映射中（`excluded_from_models`、`exclusion_reasons`），并且不会让健康结论变为降级。启动时以及每次重新加载覆盖值之后，运行时被置零的路由记录为"
" `route_weight_zeroed`（`WARNING`），被改权重的路由记录为 "
"`route_weight_overridden`（`INFO`）。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:182
msgid "Prefill-aware selection"
msgstr "prefill 感知的选路"

#: ../developer/routing.md:184
msgid ""
"Weights balance request counts, but one large cache-miss prompt can "
"occupy a replica for minutes. `apps/backend/routing/prefill_load.py` "
"tracks how many un-cached prompt tokens each endpoint is prefilling and "
"uses that to steer the draw:"
msgstr ""
"权重平衡的是请求数量，但一个未命中缓存的大提示词就可能占用一个副本好几分钟。`apps/backend/routing/prefill_load.py`"
" 跟踪每个端点正在 prefill 的未缓存提示词 token 数，并据此引导抽取："

#: ../developer/routing.md:189
msgid ""
"Selection makes two weighted draws and keeps the endpoint with less "
"prefill, once the heavier one has `ROUTING_PREFILL_INTERVENE_TOKENS` "
"queued. Below that, weights decide alone."
msgstr ""
"选路做两次按权重的抽取，保留 prefill 较少的端点，前提是较重的那个已排队 "
"`ROUTING_PREFILL_INTERVENE_TOKENS` 个 token。低于这个值时，只由权重决定。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:192
msgid ""
"Very large prompts (\"elephants\") skip endpoints at the elephant limit, "
"so they do not stack on one replica. If every endpoint is at the limit, "
"the restriction is dropped; selection never refuses."
msgstr "非常大的提示词（“大象”）会跳过已达到大象上限的端点，避免它们堆在同一个副本上。如果所有端点都达到上限，就取消这个限制；选路从不拒绝请求。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:195
msgid ""
"The un-cached size is estimated from the caller's last prompt on that "
"endpoint, so a warm continuation is not mistaken for a cold one. The hint"
" is forgotten when the endpoint fails with a 5xx or no answer."
msgstr ""
"未缓存部分的大小根据该调用方在这个端点上的上一个提示词估算，所以热的续写不会被误当成冷启动。端点以 5xx "
"失败或没有任何响应时，这个估算提示会被丢弃。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:198
msgid ""
"A lease is taken when selection commits and released at the first token. "
"It counts toward the affinity ceiling only after the request leaves the "
"gateway, and never for more than the route's context window."
msgstr "选路确定时获取租约，收到第一个 token 时释放。只有在请求离开网关之后，它才计入亲和上限，并且计入的量不超过该路由的上下文窗口。"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "`ROUTING_PREFILL_AWARE_ENABLED`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "`1`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "Set to `0` to fall back to a plain weighted draw."
msgstr "设为 `0` 即退回普通的加权抽取。"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "`ROUTING_PREFILL_INTERVENE_TOKENS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "`50000`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "Backlog at which load starts overriding the weighted draw."
msgstr "积压达到该值后，负载开始优先于权重。"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "`ROUTING_PREFILL_ELEPHANT_TOKENS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "`200000`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "Estimated un-cached tokens at which a prompt counts as an elephant."
msgstr "prompt 估算的未缓存 token 数达到该值时，算作大象。"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "`ROUTING_PREFILL_ELEPHANT_LIMIT`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "Concurrent elephants allowed per endpoint."
msgstr "每个端点允许的并发大象数。"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "`ROUTING_PREFILL_AFFINITY_CEILING`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "`150000`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "Backlog above which a request skips its affinity pin."
msgstr "积压超过该值时，请求不走它的亲和 pin。"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "`ROUTING_PREFILL_HINT_TTL_SEC`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "`1200`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "Lifetime of the per-(caller, endpoint) prompt-size memory."
msgstr "按（调用方，端点）记住的 prompt 大小保留多久。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:211
msgid "Session affinity"
msgstr "会话亲和"

#: ../developer/routing.md:213
msgid ""
"`FixedRouter` pins each (caller, model) to the endpoint it last selected,"
" for five minutes on a sliding TTL (`AFFINITY_TTL_SECONDS` in "
"`routers.py`), so a conversation keeps a warm prompt cache. The caller is"
" identified by `derive_affinity_key()` in "
"`apps/backend/serving/utils/request_ip.py`: the API key's hash, else "
"`grant:<grant_id>` for an inference grant, else `ip:<bucket>` for an "
"anonymous client (IPv6 folded to its `/64`). An anonymous request whose "
"client address cannot be resolved gets no pin. Chat completions, Messages"
" and embeddings publish the same key, so the endpoint pin and `KeyPool`'s"
" key binding agree."
msgstr ""
"`FixedRouter` 把每个（调用方，模型）绑定到它上次选中的端点，采用五分钟的滑动 TTL（`routers.py` 中的 "
"`AFFINITY_TTL_SECONDS`），让一段对话保持热的提示词缓存。调用方由 "
"`apps/backend/serving/utils/request_ip.py` 中的 `derive_affinity_key()` "
"识别：优先用 API key 的哈希；推理授权用 `grant:<grant_id>`；匿名客户端用 `ip:<bucket>`（IPv6 折叠到"
" `/64`）。无法解析客户端地址的匿名请求不建立绑定。Chat completions、Messages 和 embeddings "
"发布同一个键，所以端点绑定与 `KeyPool` 的 key 绑定是一致的。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:223
msgid ""
"Any error from the pinned endpoint drops the pin; so does the endpoint "
"becoming inadmissible."
msgstr "绑定的端点出任何错误都会丢弃绑定；端点变得不可准入时也一样。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:225
msgid ""
"Above `ROUTING_PREFILL_AFFINITY_CEILING` of backlog, the request skips "
"the pin but keeps it, and returns once the queue drains."
msgstr "积压超过 `ROUTING_PREFILL_AFFINITY_CEILING` 时，本次请求跳过绑定但保留它，等队列消化后再回来。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:227
msgid ""
"A pin lasts at most `ROUTING_AFFINITY_MAX_AGE_SEC` (default `86400`; `0` "
"turns the cap off) from when it was made, so weight changes reach busy "
"callers too."
msgstr ""
"一个绑定从建立起最多维持 `ROUTING_AFFINITY_MAX_AGE_SEC`（默认 `86400`；`0` "
"表示不设上限），这样权重变化也能作用到繁忙的调用方。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:230
msgid ""
"State is per worker and does not survive a restart. `X-Route-Pin` "
"bypasses affinity, and `ROUTING_AFFINITY_ENABLED=0` turns it off."
msgstr ""
"这些状态按 worker 保存，重启后不保留。`X-Route-Pin` 会绕过会话亲和，`ROUTING_AFFINITY_ENABLED=0`"
" 可以关闭它。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:233
msgid "Outbound concurrency"
msgstr "出站并发"

#: ../developer/routing.md:235
msgid ""
"The gateway limits how many requests it keeps open against each provider "
"label and API key, and queues the rest. A route with several keys uses "
"another key with room before it queues. The limit starts at "
"`UPSTREAM_CONCURRENCY_INITIAL_LIMIT`, drops by one on each `429`, and "
"rises by one after every `UPSTREAM_CONCURRENCY_PROBE_SUCCESS_INTERVAL` "
"successes, or on the first success a minute after it last changed (a "
"minute that doubles, up to 32 minutes, each time a rise draws a `429`). A"
" request that waits longer than "
"`UPSTREAM_CONCURRENCY_ACQUIRE_TIMEOUT_SEC` fails over to the next route "
"without being charged to the breaker."
msgstr ""
"网关限制对每个 provider 标签和 API key 同时保持打开的请求数，其余请求排队。有多个 key 的路由会先找还有空位的其他 "
"key，再排队。上限从 `UPSTREAM_CONCURRENCY_INITIAL_LIMIT` 开始，每收到一个 `429` 减一；每成功 "
"`UPSTREAM_CONCURRENCY_PROBE_SUCCESS_INTERVAL` "
"次加一，或者在上次变化一分钟后的第一次成功时加一（每当一次上调换来 `429`，这一分钟就翻倍，最多到 32 分钟）。等待超过 "
"`UPSTREAM_CONCURRENCY_ACQUIRE_TIMEOUT_SEC` 的请求会回退到下一条路由，并且不计入熔断器。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:245
msgid ""
"Self-hosted engines schedule their own work and bypass this limit. "
"Declare a route's `deployment_type` inside `route:` (the Admin Routing "
"tab offers it too):"
msgstr ""
"自部署的引擎自己调度工作，不受这个上限约束。在 `route:` 中声明路由的 `deployment_type`（Admin 的 Routing"
" 标签页也提供这个选项）："

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "`deployment_type`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "Treated as"
msgstr "视为"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "`auto` (default)"
msgstr "`auto`（默认）"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid ""
"self-hosted only for `localhost`, `127.0.0.1`, `0.0.0.0` and "
"`host.docker.internal`"
msgstr "只有 `localhost`、`127.0.0.1`、`0.0.0.0` 和 `host.docker.internal` 视为自部署"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "`self_hosted`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "an engine you operate, including on a LAN or cluster DNS"
msgstr "你自己运营的引擎，包括通过局域网或集群 DNS 访问的"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "`provider_api`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "a provider account, even behind a loopback proxy"
msgstr "provider 账号，即使在回环代理后面"

#: ../developer/routing.md:255
msgid ""
"It changes outbound admission and the hybrid composition's local/cloud "
"split, but not the URL, adapter, provider label, endpoint ID, credentials"
" or RouteWise resource type."
msgstr ""
"它会影响出站准入和混合组合的本地/云端划分，但不改变 URL、adapter、provider 标签、端点 ID、凭据或 RouteWise "
"资源类型。"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "`UPSTREAM_CONCURRENCY_ENABLED`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "`true`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid ""
"`false` disables the provider-key limit; a configured engine queue limit "
"still applies"
msgstr "`false` 关闭 provider key 并发限制；已配置的引擎队列上限仍然生效"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "`UPSTREAM_CONCURRENCY_INITIAL_LIMIT`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "`8`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "Starting limit per provider key"
msgstr "每个 provider key 的初始上限"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "`UPSTREAM_CONCURRENCY_MAX_LIMIT`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "`64`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "Highest the limit can rise"
msgstr "上限最高能升到的值"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "`UPSTREAM_CONCURRENCY_PROBE_SUCCESS_INTERVAL`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "`100`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "Successful responses between increases"
msgstr "两次上调之间需要的成功响应数"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "`UPSTREAM_CONCURRENCY_ACQUIRE_TIMEOUT_SEC`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "Longest a request waits for a slot before failing over"
msgstr "请求等待槽位的最长时间，超时后转去下一条路由"

#: ../developer/routing.md:267
msgid "Queue-wait offload"
msgstr "排队等待卸载"

#: ../developer/routing.md:269
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A `fixed` model can reserve one route as its **offload route**, for "
"requests its other routes cannot start in time. Set it in the admin "
"console (**Routing → Queue offload**) or with `PUT /admin/routing"
"/offload-routes/{model_id}`: a route id, a wait in seconds, and "
"optionally an [engine queue limit](#engine-queue-limit) and a [max "
"offload input](#max-offload-input). It is stored in `site_settings` under"
" `model_offload_route:<model_id>`; the logic is in "
"`apps/backend/routing/offload.py`."
msgstr ""
"`fixed` 模型可以预留一条路由作为它的**卸载路由**，用于其他路由无法及时开始处理的请求。可以在管理控制台中设置（**Routing → "
"Queue offload**），也可以用 `PUT /admin/routing/offload-routes/{model_id}`：指定路由"
" id、等待秒数，以及可选的[引擎队列上限](#engine-queue-limit)和[最大卸载输入](#max-offload-"
"input)。它保存在 `site_settings` 的 `model_offload_route:<model_id>` 下；逻辑在 "
"`apps/backend/routing/offload.py` 中。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:278
msgid ""
"The offload route takes no ordinary traffic: the draw, affinity and "
"preferred targets skip it while another route is admissible."
msgstr "卸载路由不接普通流量：只要还有其他可准入的路由，抽取、会话亲和和首选目标都会跳过它。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:280
msgid ""
"Every other attempt may wait at most the configured seconds for an "
"outbound slot; then it leaves the queue and the offload route is tried "
"next. Leaving the queue is safe because nothing was sent upstream."
msgstr "其他每次尝试最多为一个出站名额等待所配置的秒数；超时后它离开队列，接着尝试卸载路由。离开队列是安全的，因为还没有任何内容发往上游。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:283
msgid ""
"The offload route is also the last fallback, and the primary when nothing"
" else is admissible. A request is offloaded at most once."
msgstr "卸载路由也是最后的回退，并且在没有其他可准入路由时充当主路由。一个请求最多被卸载一次。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:285
msgid ""
"If the offload route fails, the attempt cut short for it is retried once,"
" last, with the full acquire timeout, so an offload never fails a request"
" its own route would have served."
msgstr "如果卸载路由也失败，为它而中断的那次尝试会在最后重试一次，并使用完整的获取超时，所以卸载永远不会让一个本来能由自己的路由处理的请求失败。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:289
msgid "Engine waits"
msgstr "引擎等待"

#: ../developer/routing.md:291
msgid ""
"The gateway cannot see an engine's own queue, so for a model with an "
"offload route, each streaming attempt on its other routes also waits at "
"most the same seconds for the first token "
"(`apps/backend/routing/engine_wait.py`). An attempt with no token in time"
" is cancelled at the engine and offloaded. Output before the first token "
"is held back (up to 1 MB; past that the stream is committed and "
"`first_token_hold_cap_reached` is logged), so the client never sees the "
"abandoned attempt. The wait counts from when the request leaves the "
"gateway and includes prefill, so a model with very long prompts needs a "
"longer wait. Nothing is recorded against the engine. Once an adapter "
"reports reading output it holds back (an XML tool call, a `<think>` "
"block, tool-call JSON), the request waits as long as the engine needs. "
"Non-streaming requests are not watched."
msgstr ""
"网关看不到引擎自己的队列，所以对于有卸载路由的模型，其他路由上的每次流式尝试还要为第一个 token "
"最多等待同样的秒数（`apps/backend/routing/engine_wait.py`）。在规定时间内没有收到 token "
"的尝试会在引擎端被取消并卸载。第一个 token 之前的输出会被暂存（最多 1 MB；超过后流即被确定，并记录 "
"`first_token_hold_cap_reached`），所以客户端永远看不到被放弃的那次尝试。等待从请求离开网关时开始计时，并包含 "
"prefill，所以提示词很长的模型需要更长的等待时间。不会对引擎记录任何东西。一旦 adapter 报告它读到了需要暂存的输出（XML "
"工具调用、`<think>` 块、工具调用 JSON），请求就会一直等到引擎给出结果。非流式请求不受监视。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:304
msgid ""
"A response served by the offload route carries `_routing.offload`: "
"`queue_wait`, `engine_wait` or `last_resort`. The request log keeps it, "
"each dispatch logs `route_offload`, and if the offload route fails, the "
"marker stays and `offload_endpoint_id` names it. The admin **Recent "
"Requests** tab shows an **Offloaded requests** table for the last 24 "
"hours, served by `GET /admin/recent-requests/offloads` (`days` defaults "
"to `1`)."
msgstr ""
"由卸载路由处理的响应带有 `_routing.offload`：`queue_wait`、`engine_wait` 或 "
"`last_resort`。请求日志会保留它，每次分派都会记录 `route_offload`；如果卸载路由失败，这个标记仍然保留，并由 "
"`offload_endpoint_id` 指明卸载路由。管理控制台的 **Recent Requests** 标签页有一个 "
"**Offloaded requests** 表，显示最近 24 小时的数据，由 `GET /admin/recent-"
"requests/offloads` 提供（`days` 默认为 `1`）。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:311
msgid "Nothing is offloaded for:"
msgstr "以下情况不会卸载："

#: ../developer/routing.md:313
msgid ""
"a non-streaming request to an endpoint the gateway does not queue for: a "
"self-hosted engine, or any provider while "
"`UPSTREAM_CONCURRENCY_ENABLED=false`;"
msgstr ""
"发往网关不为其排队的端点的非流式请求：自部署的引擎，或者在 `UPSTREAM_CONCURRENCY_ENABLED=false` 时的任何 "
"provider；"

#: ../developer/routing.md:315
msgid ""
"a pinned request, or an attempt whose caller owns the candidate order "
"(`allow_fallback` off, as in the hybrid composition);"
msgstr "固定到某条路由的请求，或者由调用方决定候选顺序的尝试（`allow_fallback` 关闭，混合组合就是这样）；"

#: ../developer/routing.md:317
msgid ""
"a prompt the offload route's `context_length` cannot fit, or one over the"
" max offload input;"
msgstr "卸载路由的 `context_length` 装不下的提示词，或者超过最大卸载输入的提示词；"

#: ../developer/routing.md:319
msgid ""
"`/v1/messages`, which keeps the offload route out of its single pick "
"unless nothing else is eligible, but never offloads on a wait;"
msgstr "`/v1/messages`：它在唯一一次挑选中排除卸载路由，除非没有其他合格的路由，但从不因等待而卸载；"

#: ../developer/routing.md:321
msgid ""
"`routewise` models and `fixed` models with `hybrid_composition: true`. "
"The admin API refuses an offload route on either and refuses to switch a "
"model that has one to `routewise`; a policy stored earlier is listed as "
"inactive."
msgstr ""
"`routewise` 模型，以及设置了 `hybrid_composition: true` 的 `fixed` 模型。管理 API "
"拒绝为它们设置卸载路由，也拒绝把已有卸载路由的模型切换到 `routewise`；之前保存的策略会被列为未生效。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:325
msgid ""
"The wait must be positive and may exceed the acquire timeout, in which "
"case it bounds only the first token. The offload route needs an effective"
" weight above `0`: a weight override of `0`, a disabled provider or a "
"disabled route turns the offload off, and `GET /admin/routing/offload-"
"routes` reports `active: false` with an `inactive_reason`. Deleting a "
"runtime route that is an offload route is refused until the offload route"
" is cleared."
msgstr ""
"等待时间必须为正数，可以超过获取超时，这时它只约束第一个 token。卸载路由的有效权重必须大于 `0`：权重覆盖为 `0`、provider "
"被禁用或路由被禁用都会让卸载失效，`GET /admin/routing/offload-routes` 会报告 `active: false` "
"和 `inactive_reason`。如果要删除的运行时路由是某个模型的卸载路由，删除会被拒绝，直到清除该卸载路由为止。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:332
msgid "Engine queue limit"
msgstr "引擎队列上限"

#: ../developer/routing.md:334
msgid ""
"With an **engine queue limit** of N (`engine_queue_limit` in the API), "
"each self-hosted engine of the model is sent at most N streaming requests"
" that have not yet returned a first token; the rest wait in the gateway, "
"in arrival order (`EngineHold` in "
"`apps/backend/serving/adapters/upstream_limiter.py`). A place frees at "
"the first token, so the limit caps how many requests wait or prefill at "
"the engine, not how many it runs. A held request that can be offloaded "
"leaves at the wait, before the engine sees it. One that cannot keeps its "
"place for up to `UPSTREAM_CONCURRENCY_ACQUIRE_TIMEOUT_SEC` and is then "
"sent anyway: the hold never fails a request. Non-streaming requests and "
"provider routes are not held."
msgstr ""
"设置**引擎队列上限**为 N（API 中为 `engine_queue_limit`）后，模型的每个自部署引擎最多同时收到 N 个尚未返回第一个"
" token "
"的流式请求；其余请求按到达顺序在网关中等待（`apps/backend/serving/adapters/upstream_limiter.py`"
" 中的 `EngineHold`）。收到第一个 token 时就会空出一个位置，所以这个上限限制的是在引擎处等待或 prefill "
"的请求数，而不是它同时运行的请求数。可以卸载的暂存请求会在等待时间到时离开，此时引擎还没见过它。不能卸载的请求会保留位置最多 "
"`UPSTREAM_CONCURRENCY_ACQUIRE_TIMEOUT_SEC`，然后照样发出：暂存从不让请求失败。非流式请求和 "
"provider 路由不会被暂存。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:345
msgid ""
"Use `deployment_type: self_hosted` for an engine on another machine. That"
" alone neither sets a limit nor reserves an offload route, and reserving "
"a route takes it out of ordinary traffic; to share traffic between two "
"routes, use weights. A limit of `1` sends a request only once the "
"previous one has started answering; higher limits let the engine prefill "
"several prompts at once. The count is per gateway process, not a shared "
"limit on the engine."
msgstr ""
"位于另一台机器上的引擎，请使用 `deployment_type: "
"self_hosted`。这项声明本身既不设置上限，也不预留卸载路由；预留一条路由会让它退出普通流量，如果想让两条路由分担流量，请使用权重。上限为"
" `1` 时，只有前一个请求开始回答后才发送下一个；更高的上限让引擎可以同时 prefill "
"多个提示词。计数按网关进程进行，不是对引擎的共享上限。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:352
msgid "Max offload input"
msgstr "最大卸载输入"

#: ../developer/routing.md:354
msgid ""
"With a **max offload input** of N tokens (`max_input_tokens` in the API),"
" a prompt estimated at more than N tokens is never sent to the offload "
"route. It waits as long as its own routes need, has no last resort, and "
"gets `503` when no other route is admissible. The estimate is the "
"router's own (`estimate_prefill_tokens` in "
"`apps/backend/routing/prefill_load.py`): 4 bytes of UTF-8 a token over "
"everything sent upstream, plus 85 tokens per image and 200 per audio "
"input. No tokenizer runs, so leave headroom when the limit stands in for "
"the offload route's context window. A pinned request goes where it is "
"pinned, whatever its size."
msgstr ""
"设置**最大卸载输入**为 N 个 token（API 中为 `max_input_tokens`）后，估算超过 N 个 token "
"的提示词永远不会发往卸载路由。它会等待自己的路由所需的全部时间，没有最后的退路，并且在没有其他可准入路由时得到 `503`。估算来自 router"
" 自己（`apps/backend/routing/prefill_load.py` 中的 "
"`estimate_prefill_tokens`）：对发往上游的全部内容按每 4 字节 UTF-8 文本计一个 token，每张图片另计 85 "
"个 token，每段音频另计 200 "
"个。这里不运行分词器，所以当这个上限代替卸载路由的上下文窗口时，要留些余量。固定到某条路由的请求不论大小，都发往固定的路由。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:364
msgid "RouteWise"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md:366
msgid ""
"`routewise` keeps the average time to first token as low as it can within"
" a cost budget: it prices every usable route, measures how fast each "
"starts answering, and picks the fastest mix for the money. Each model "
"with `router: routewise` gets its own `RouteWiseRouter`."
msgstr ""
"`routewise` 在成本预算内尽量降低平均首 token "
"时间：它为每条可用路由计价，测量每条路由开始回答的速度，并挑出性价比最高的组合。每个设置了 `router: routewise` "
"的模型都有自己的 `RouteWiseRouter`。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:371
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The algorithm is the MIT-licensed [`llm-"
"routewise`](https://github.com/HarvardMadSys/RouteWise) package, a "
"required dependency that does no network I/O and reads no credentials. "
"The design is described in *RouteWise: Latency--Cost Optimization for "
"Multi-Provider LLM Routing* (EuroSys '27). If the package is missing, the"
" backend still starts unless a model selects `routewise`. A registry you "
"can run unedited against two loopback providers is in "
"[`config/examples/models.routewise.json`](../../config/examples/models.routewise.json),"
" and {download}`config/examples/routewise-options.md "
"<../../config/examples/routewise-options.md>` describes every option."
msgstr ""
"算法来自采用 MIT 许可的 [`llm-"
"routewise`](https://github.com/HarvardMadSys/RouteWise) 包，它是必需的依赖，不做任何网络 "
"I/O，也不读取凭据。设计见 *RouteWise: Latency--Cost Optimization for Multi-Provider "
"LLM Routing*（EuroSys '27）。缺少这个包时，后端照常启动，除非有模型选择了 `routewise`。可以直接对两个回环 "
"provider 运行的注册表在 "
"[`config/examples/models.routewise.json`](../../config/examples/models.routewise.json)"
" 中，{download}`config/examples/routewise-options.md <../../config/examples"
"/routewise-options.md>` 说明了每个选项。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:382
msgid ""
"**Measurements.** Until RouteWise has measured an endpoint, it sends "
"everything to the cheapest one. It learns from live traffic, from request"
" logs replayed at startup (`db_bootstrap_enabled`, on by default) and "
"from its latency prober (`routewise_probe_enabled`, off by default). A "
"new deployment has no logs, so turn the prober on. All RouteWise models "
"in a worker share one probe limit, the lowest "
"`routewise_probe_max_concurrency` (default `1`) any of them sets, so two "
"models on one subscription do not probe it at once. A database lease "
"(`routewise_probe_leases`) keeps two workers from probing the same model."
msgstr ""
"**测量**。RouteWise "
"在测量某个端点之前，会把所有请求发给最便宜的那个。它从实时流量、启动时回放的请求日志（`db_bootstrap_enabled`，默认开启）以及它的延迟探测器（`routewise_probe_enabled`，默认关闭）中学习。新部署没有日志可回放，所以要打开探测器。同一个"
" worker 中的所有 RouteWise 模型共用一个探测上限，取它们设置的 "
"`routewise_probe_max_concurrency`（默认 "
"`1`）中的最小值，这样同一订阅上的两个模型不会同时探测它。数据库租约（`routewise_probe_leases`）防止两个 worker "
"同时探测同一个模型。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:391
msgid "**Configuration** splits by ownership:"
msgstr "**配置**按归属划分："

#: ../developer/routing.md:393
msgid ""
"`router_params:` (per model) holds algorithm settings. The fields of "
"`RouteWiseConfig` in `apps/backend/routing/routewise/config.py` are the "
"complete list, with their defaults."
msgstr ""
"`router_params:`（按模型）保存算法设置。`apps/backend/routing/routewise/config.py` 中 "
"`RouteWiseConfig` 的字段就是完整列表，并附有默认值。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:396
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Route entries hold resources: `provider_type: on_demand | quota | "
"concurrency`, `pricing:`, `quota: {limit}` with a `quota_source:`, "
"`concurrency: {limit}`, and `quota_pool:` / `concurrency_pool:` ids for "
"routes that share one subscription."
msgstr ""
"路由条目保存资源设置：`provider_type: on_demand | quota | "
"concurrency`、`pricing:`、`quota: {limit}` 及其 `quota_source:`、`concurrency:"
" {limit}`，以及供共享同一订阅的路由使用的 `quota_pool:` / `concurrency_pool:` id。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:401
msgid ""
"A resource limit in `router_params:` fails at boot with a message naming "
"its route-level replacement. The retired keys "
"`prefill_load_routing_enabled`, `prefill_load_scale_ms_per_1k`, "
"`prefill_load_max_penalty_ms` and `latency_min_samples` are ignored with "
"a warning; remove them. RouteWise does not use prefill load."
msgstr ""
"写在 `router_params:` 中的资源上限会在启动时报错，消息会指出它在路由级别的替代写法。已停用的键 "
"`prefill_load_routing_enabled`、`prefill_load_scale_ms_per_1k`、`prefill_load_max_penalty_ms`"
" 和 `latency_min_samples` 会被忽略并给出警告；请删除它们。RouteWise 不使用 prefill 负载。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:407
msgid ""
"**Hedging.** With `latency_hedge_mode: probability_target`, a primary "
"that has not started answering by a checkpoint may be raced against a "
"backup. RouteWise expects longer prompts to start later, so a long "
"prefill alone does not trigger a hedge. A primary that refuses the "
"request as malformed or too long gets no backup, and RouteWise stops re-"
"solving after two malformed refusals. The stream race's 60-second "
"deadline counts as a failed attempt of each open leg, but is charged to "
"no breaker."
msgstr ""
"**对冲**。设置 `latency_hedge_mode: probability_target` "
"后，主路由到某个检查点还没开始回答时，可能会与一个备用路由竞速。RouteWise 预期较长的提示词开始得更晚，所以单纯 prefill "
"时间长不会触发对冲。以格式错误或过长为由拒绝请求的主路由不会得到备用路由，并且在两次格式错误拒绝之后 RouteWise 停止重新求解。流式竞速的"
" 60 秒期限会记为每条仍未结束的分支的一次失败尝试，但不计入任何熔断器。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:415
#, no-python-format, python-format
msgid ""
"**Weights do not split traffic.** Every route with a weight above `0` is "
"a full candidate, so a 1% canary or a last-resort route becomes a peer. "
"Set its weight to `0` to keep it out (`optional: true` only controls "
"whether a route with unset environment is skipped). The admin console "
"refuses to switch a model to `routewise` while it has such a weighting, "
"and the router logs `routewise_route_weights_ignored` when one arrives "
"another way."
msgstr ""
"**权重不用于分流**。每条权重大于 `0` 的路由都是完整的候选，所以 1% 的金丝雀路由或最后备用的路由也会成为平等的一员。把它的权重设为 "
"`0` 才能把它排除在外（`optional: true` "
"只决定环境变量未设置的路由是否被跳过）。模型带有这种权重配置时，管理控制台拒绝把它切换到 "
"`routewise`；如果这种权重通过其他途径到达，router 会记录 `routewise_route_weights_ignored`。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:422
msgid ""
"**Quota sources.** `quota_source:` names a `provider`, `usage_label` and "
"`unit` that must match exactly a usage record from that provider's quota "
"fetcher. The gateway ships no fetchers: a backend extension registers one"
" with `register_quota_fetcher` (see [Quota reporting](backend-"
"extensions.md#quota-reporting)). A source that never matches leaves the "
"route unready and skipped, with no warning, so check a new one against "
"its fetcher. The [local quota "
"example](../../config/examples/models.routewise.quota.json) runs without "
"a real supplier account. The `local` provider on admin-created routes is "
"a per-worker daily request counter (reset at server midnight, zero after "
"a restart), used when `route_metadata` sets `local_quota_fallback: true` "
"or the route and upstream providers differ. Any other window or limit "
"needs a real `quota_source`."
msgstr ""
"**配额来源**。`quota_source:` 指定的 `provider`、`usage_label` 和 `unit` 必须与该 "
"provider 的配额获取器返回的某条用量记录完全一致。网关不自带获取器：由后端扩展用 `register_quota_fetcher` "
"注册（见[配额上报](backend-extensions.md#quota-"
"reporting)）。始终匹配不上的来源会让路由一直处于未就绪状态并被跳过，而且没有任何警告，所以要对照获取器检查新的来源。[本地配额示例](../../config/examples/models.routewise.quota.json)无需真实的供应商账号即可运行。管理员创建的路由上出现的"
" `local` provider 是按 worker 计数的每日请求计数器（在服务器本地午夜重置，重启后归零），用于 "
"`route_metadata` 设置了 `local_quota_fallback: true`，或者路由与上游 provider "
"不同的情况。其他任何时间窗口或额度都需要真正的 `quota_source`。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:435
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Endpoint identity.** Latency profiles, availability and logs are keyed "
"by `{model_id}:{location}` (`registry._make_provider_id`): `local-{port}`"
" for a local host, otherwise a name from the hostname for generic kinds "
"(`api.minimax.io` → `minimax-api`) or `{kind}-api`. Changing the port or "
"vendor host renames the endpoint and restarts its latency profile."
msgstr ""
"**端点标识**。延迟画像、可用率和日志都以 `{model_id}:{location}` "
"为键（`registry._make_provider_id`）：本地主机为 `local-{port}`，否则通用 kind "
"取主机名中的名称（`api.minimax.io` → `minimax-api`），其他 kind 为 "
"`{kind}-api`。更改端口或供应商主机会重命名端点，并重新开始它的延迟画像。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:441
msgid ""
"**Startup.** A quota route needs a cost envelope calibrated from recent "
"traffic. Beside a non-quota route it starts masked; a model with only "
"quota routes raises `EnvelopeNotCalibratedError` and startup fails. "
"RouteWise state is per process, so a `quota` or `concurrency` route with "
"`WEB_CONCURRENCY`, `UVICORN_WORKERS` or `GUNICORN_WORKERS` above 1 also "
"fails startup (`stateful_providers_single_worker_only`, default true)."
msgstr ""
"**启动**。配额路由需要一个根据近期流量校准过的成本包络。与非配额路由并存时，它在启动时被屏蔽；只有配额路由的模型会抛出 "
"`EnvelopeNotCalibratedError`，启动失败。RouteWise 的状态按进程保存，所以当 "
"`WEB_CONCURRENCY`、`UVICORN_WORKERS` 或 `GUNICORN_WORKERS` 大于 1 时，存在 "
"`quota` 或 `concurrency` "
"路由也会导致启动失败（`stateful_providers_single_worker_only`，默认为 true）。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:448
msgid ""
"**Runtime tuning.** The model id is a query parameter because it may "
"contain `/`:"
msgstr "**运行时调优**。模型 id 作为查询参数传递，因为它可能包含 `/`："

#: ../developer/routing.md:457
msgid ""
"An alias reads and writes its canonical model's settings, and `DELETE` "
"restores the inherited value. `GET`/`PATCH /admin/routewise/settings` set"
" the fallback for models with neither an override nor a `router_params:` "
"value."
msgstr ""
"别名读写的是其规范模型的设置，`DELETE` 会恢复继承的值。`GET`/`PATCH /admin/routewise/settings` "
"为既没有覆盖值、也没有 `router_params:` 值的模型设置后备值。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:461
msgid "Reserving upstream keys for a tier"
msgstr "为某个层级预留上游 key"

#: ../developer/routing.md:463
msgid ""
"A provider key can be reserved for a role and above with its `min_role` "
"(`free`, the default, means no reservation; then `pro`, `internal`, "
"`admin`). The catalog's `required_role` decides what a user may call; a "
"key's `min_role` decides whose requests may spend it."
msgstr ""
"provider key 可以通过它的 `min_role` 预留给某个角色及以上的用户（默认的 `free` 表示不预留；往上依次是 "
"`pro`、`internal`、`admin`）。模型目录的 `required_role` 决定用户可以调用什么；key 的 "
"`min_role` 决定谁的请求可以使用这个 key。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:468
msgid ""
"`KeyPool` (`apps/backend/serving/adapters/key_pool.py`) hides reserved "
"keys from callers below their role and offers the most reserved keys "
"first."
msgstr ""
"`KeyPool`（`apps/backend/serving/adapters/key_pool.py`）对角色不够的调用方隐藏预留的 "
"key，并优先提供预留级别最高的 key。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:470
msgid ""
"A caller with no usable key gets `KeyPoolExhausted`, and the router fails"
" over. When the pool could still serve a higher tier, the refusal is "
"`KeyPoolRoleRestricted` and does not count against the endpoint's health."
msgstr ""
"没有可用 key 的调用方会得到 `KeyPoolExhausted`，router 随即回退。如果这个池仍能为更高层级服务，拒绝就是 "
"`KeyPoolRoleRestricted`，不会计入端点的健康状态。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:473
msgid "`/v1/messages` picks the first adapter holding a key the caller may spend."
msgstr "`/v1/messages` 选择第一个持有该调用方可用 key 的 adapter。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:474
msgid "Requests with no user identity (probes, warmups) are unrestricted."
msgstr "没有用户身份的请求（探测、预热）不受限制。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:476
msgid "Set reservations through the admin API; they apply immediately:"
msgstr "通过管理 API 设置预留，立即生效："

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "Source"
msgstr "来源"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "Endpoint"
msgstr "端点"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "Where the reservation lives"
msgstr "预留记录在哪里"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "Database (dashboard-added)"
msgstr "数据库（从仪表盘添加的）"

#: ../developer/routing.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`POST /admin/provider-keys/{key_id}/min-role`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "`provider_api_keys.min_role`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "Environment (`<PROVIDER>_API_KEY`, registry `api_keys`)"
msgstr "环境变量（`<PROVIDER>_API_KEY`，注册表里的 `api_keys`）"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "`POST /admin/provider-keys/min-role-env`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "`provider_env_key_min_roles`, keyed by the key's hash"
msgstr "`provider_env_key_min_roles`，以该 key 的哈希为键"

#: ../developer/routing.md:483
msgid ""
"New keys accept `min_role` on `POST /admin/provider-keys`. An environment"
" key's reservation is keyed by hash, so it survives the key leaving "
"rotation. When one credential is configured twice, the most restrictive "
"declaration wins. `POST /admin/provider-keys/remove-env` (same body as "
"disable) removes an environment key for good: it blanks the saved "
"settings that hold it and refuses to re-enable it until it is configured "
"again."
msgstr ""
"新 key 可以在 `POST /admin/provider-keys` 中带上 `min_role`。环境变量 key 的预留以哈希为键，所以"
" key 退出轮换后预留仍然保留。同一个凭据配置了两次时，以最严格的声明为准。`POST /admin/provider-keys/remove-"
"env`（请求体与禁用相同）会彻底删除一个环境变量 key：它清空保存该凭据的设置项，并在重新配置之前拒绝再启用它。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:490
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A catalog route that names a removed key setting (`api_key: "
"${DEEPSEEK_API_KEY}` or an `api_keys` entry) keeps serving after a "
"restart, on the provider's other key settings and the Keys-tab keys "
"present at boot. With neither, the route is not registered, and a model "
"left with no route is skipped; so is a model whose key setting is blank "
"in the environment or was never set. Remove returns 409 when a route "
"would be left with no key (the provider has no other key, or the route "
"draws keys from a provider that does not own the setting): disable the "
"key instead, or add another first."
msgstr ""
"目录中某条路由引用的 key 设置项被移除后（`api_key: ${DEEPSEEK_API_KEY}` 或 `api_keys` "
"中的一项），重启后它仍会继续服务，使用该 provider 的其他 key 设置项和启动时已有的 Keys 标签页中的 "
"key。两者都没有时，这条路由不会被注册，没有任何路由的模型会被跳过；环境变量中 key "
"设置项为空或从未设置的模型同样会被跳过。如果移除后某条路由将没有任何 key 可用（该 provider 没有其他 "
"key，或者这条路由从不拥有该设置项的 provider 那里取 key），Remove 会返回 409：请改为禁用这个 key，或者先添加另一个"
" key。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:499
msgid ""
"Reservations work only through `KeyPool`: on `openai_compat` and "
"`openrouter` routes, and single-key routes once a reservation applies. "
"The `anthropic`, `claude` and `gemini` adapters ignore them; gate those "
"models with `required_role`."
msgstr ""
"预留只通过 `KeyPool` 生效：作用于 `openai_compat` 和 `openrouter` 路由，以及适用预留之后的单 key "
"路由。`anthropic`、`claude` 和 `gemini` adapter 会忽略预留；这些模型请用 `required_role` "
"来限制。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:504
msgid "Auto models"
msgstr "Auto 模型"

#: ../developer/routing.md:506
msgid ""
"An auto model picks the model, not the endpoint. A client names a tier, "
"such as `auto-balance`, and each request goes to one of the tier's "
"candidate models and is served as a request for that model. Tiers are "
"defined in an `auto:` section of the model registry, next to `models:`:"
msgstr ""
"auto 模型选择的是模型，而不是端点。客户端指定一个层级，例如 `auto-"
"balance`，每个请求会被发给该层级的某个候选模型，并像直接请求那个模型一样处理。层级定义在模型注册表的 `auto:` 部分，与 "
"`models:` 并列："

#: ../developer/routing.md:558
msgid ""
"Each profile is served as `auto-<name>`, and bare `auto` serves "
"`default_profile`. Auto models exist only while the `auto_mode_enabled` "
"runtime setting is on (off by default; the Settings tab offers it once "
"the backend has started with a valid `auto:` section). While it is off "
"they get 404 and are not listed."
msgstr ""
"每个 profile 以 `auto-<name>` 提供服务，单独的 `auto` 对应 `default_profile`。只有当 "
"`auto_mode_enabled` 运行时设置项开启时，auto 模型才存在（默认关闭；后端以有效的 `auto:` "
"部分启动后，Settings 标签页才提供这个开关）。关闭时，请求它们会得到 404，它们也不会出现在模型列表中。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:564
msgid ""
"**Which candidate serves:** the first one that can. A candidate is "
"skipped when the caller may not use its model, none of its endpoints is "
"admitted, the request needs tools or an input kind the model lacks, the "
"prompt estimate (times 1.25, plus `max_tokens`) does not fit its smallest"
" context window, or the model does not accept the candidate's "
"`reasoning_effort` (applied only when the request sets none)."
msgstr ""
"**由哪个候选处理**：第一个能处理的候选。以下情况会跳过候选：调用方不能使用它的模型；它的端点没有一个被准入；请求需要模型不支持的工具或输入类型；提示词估算值（乘以"
" 1.25，再加上 `max_tokens`）放不进它最小的上下文窗口；或者模型不接受该候选的 "
"`reasoning_effort`（只有请求自己没设置时才会应用）。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:571
msgid ""
"**Sessions.** A conversation in its tool loop (the last message carries a"
" tool result) stays on its model until that model cannot serve; a new "
"user turn ranks the candidates again. A conversation is identified by the"
" caller, the declared session and its opening messages. Sessions live in "
"process for `idle_timeout_seconds`, at most `max_sessions` of them. When "
"a session has changed models and goes to an Anthropic-native endpoint, "
"earlier thinking blocks are removed first."
msgstr ""
"**会话**。处于工具调用循环中的对话（最后一条消息带有工具结果）会一直留在它的模型上，直到该模型无法处理；新的用户轮次会重新给候选排序。对话由调用方、声明的会话和开头的几条消息来识别。会话保存在进程内，存活"
" `idle_timeout_seconds`，最多保留 `max_sessions` 个。当会话换过模型并发往 Anthropic "
"原生端点时，会先删除之前的 thinking 块。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:579
msgid ""
"**Errors:** 404 when the caller can use none of the tier's models, 503 "
"when a usable model has no endpoint admitted, and 400 when every usable "
"model is unable to take the request."
msgstr "**错误**：调用方不能使用该层级的任何模型时返回 404；可用的模型没有被准入的端点时返回 503；所有可用的模型都无法处理该请求时返回 400。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:583
msgid ""
"**What the client sees** is always the auto model: in responses, stream "
"chunks, error messages, request history and grant ledgers. `/v1/models` "
"lists an auto model to callers who may use any of its models. The log "
"row's `model_id` is the model that served the request, with the decision "
"in `metadata.auto`."
msgstr ""
"**客户端看到的**始终是 auto 模型：响应、流式 chunk、错误消息、请求记录和授权台账中都是如此。`/v1/models` "
"会向可以使用其中任一模型的调用方列出该 auto 模型。日志行的 `model_id` 是实际处理请求的模型，决策记录在 "
"`metadata.auto` 中。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:588
msgid ""
"An invalid `auto:` section, or a tier named like a registered model, "
"turns auto off and logs why. The admin API refuses models named `auto` or"
" `auto-<anything>`, and the admin playground does not offer auto models."
msgstr ""
"`auto:` 部分无效，或者某个层级与已注册的模型同名时，auto 会被关闭并记录原因。管理 API 拒绝创建名为 `auto` 或 "
"`auto-<anything>` 的模型，管理员 playground 也不提供 auto 模型。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:592
msgid "API endpoints"
msgstr "API 端点"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "用途"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "`GET /v1/models`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "List published models."
msgstr "列出已发布的模型。"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "`POST /v1/chat/completions`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "Chat completion with automatic routing."
msgstr "带自动路由的对话补全。"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "`GET /health`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid ""
"Liveness: `status` for anyone; an administrator also sees the "
"`routes_configured` count and each store's state."
msgstr "存活检查：任何人都能看到 `status`；管理员还能看到 `routes_configured` 数量和每个存储的状态。"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "`GET /health/deep`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "Per-endpoint availability, circuit state, and `route_exclusions`."
msgstr "每个端点的可用性、熔断状态，以及 `route_exclusions`。"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "`GET /routing`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid ""
"Current weight distribution per model; for an administrator, also each "
"route's `base_url` and the probe's `endpoint_health` map."
msgstr "每个模型当前的权重分布；对管理员还会给出每条路由的 `base_url` 和探测循环的 `endpoint_health` 映射。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:602
msgid ""
"These three status endpoints need no authentication. Anonymous callers "
"see no upstream addresses: `/routing` shows each route's `provider` and "
"weight, and `/health/deep` keys `providers` by `endpoint_id`. Only an "
"administrator's JWT or `ADMIN_TOKEN`, sent as `Authorization: Bearer "
"...`, shows base URLs and the probe's `endpoint_health` map; any other "
"credential gets the anonymous answer. An `endpoint_id` can still reveal a"
" local port or a host's first label (`local-12003`, `10-api`); gate these"
" paths at your reverse proxy if that is too much."
msgstr ""
"这三个状态端点都不需要鉴权。匿名调用方看不到任何上游地址：`/routing` 显示每条路由的 `provider` "
"和权重，`/health/deep` 以 `endpoint_id` 为键列出 `providers`。只有以 `Authorization: "
"Bearer ...` 发送管理员 JWT 或 `ADMIN_TOKEN`，才能看到 base URL 和探测的 "
"`endpoint_health` 映射；其他任何凭据得到的都是匿名结果。`endpoint_id` "
"仍可能透露本地端口或主机名的第一段（`local-12003`、`10-api`）；如果连这些都不能暴露，请在反向代理上限制这些路径。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:611
msgid "Admin endpoints for routing, all behind admin authentication:"
msgstr "路由相关的管理端点，都需要管理员鉴权："

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "`GET /admin/routing`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "The weight distribution, including unpublished routes."
msgstr "权重分布，包括未发布的路由。"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "`GET /admin/routing/provider-routes`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Every route the gateway serves, per model, tagged `source: yaml`, "
"`override` or `runtime`; `.../{model_id}` for one model."
msgstr ""
"网关服务的每一条路由，按模型列出，标着 `source: yaml`、`override` 或 "
"`runtime`；`.../{model_id}` 只看一个模型。"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "`POST /admin/routing/provider-route-models`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "Create a runtime model with its first route."
msgstr "创建一个运行时模型，连同它的第一条路由。"

#: ../developer/routing.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`POST /admin/routing/provider-route-candidates/{model_id}`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Add a route to a model; `PATCH` and `DELETE` on "
"`.../{model_id}/{route_id}` edit or remove it."
msgstr "给模型加一条路由；对 `.../{model_id}/{route_id}` 做 `PATCH` 和 `DELETE` 来编辑或删除它。"

#: ../developer/routing.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`PUT /admin/routing/provider-routes/{model_id}/{route_id}`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "Retarget a registry route; `DELETE` restores the YAML route."
msgstr "把注册表里的路由改指向别处；`DELETE` 恢复 YAML 路由。"

#: ../developer/routing.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`PATCH /admin/routing/provider-route-states/{model_id}/{route_id}`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid ""
"Disable or enable a route of either source; a disabled route keeps its "
"weights but takes no request, retry, fallback or offload."
msgstr "停用或启用一条路由（两种来源都可以）；停用的路由保留权重，但不接收任何请求、重试、fallback 或 offload。"

#: ../developer/routing.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`PATCH /admin/routing/provider-route-batch/{model_id}/{route_id}`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid ""
"Allow or forbid batch work on a route, or let it follow its locality "
"(`null`): see [Which routes batch work may use](batches.md#which-routes-"
"batch-work-may-use)."
msgstr ""
"允许或禁止某条路由执行批处理，或让它重新按所在位置决定（`null`）：参见[批处理可以使用哪些路由](batches.md#which-"
"routes-batch-work-may-use)。"

#: ../developer/routing.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`POST` / `DELETE /admin/routing/provider-route-"
"removals/{model_id}/{route_id}`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid ""
"Delete a registry route from this deployment, or restore it; the catalog "
"baseline is not changed."
msgstr "从此部署删除或恢复某条目录路由；不会修改目录基线。"

#: ../developer/routing.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`PUT` / `DELETE /admin/routing/weights/{model_id}/{endpoint_id}`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "Set or clear a weight override."
msgstr "设置或清除权重覆盖项。"

#: ../developer/routing.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`PATCH /admin/routing/provider-route-strategies/{model_id}`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "Switch a model's router."
msgstr "切换模型的 router。"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "`GET /admin/routing/offload-routes`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Every model's offload route and whether routing applies it; `PUT` / "
"`DELETE .../{model_id}` sets or clears one — see [Queue-wait offload"
"](#queue-wait-offload)."
msgstr ""
"每个模型的卸载路由，以及它当前是否生效；`PUT` / `DELETE .../{model_id}` 用来设置或清除——见[排队等待卸载"
"](#queue-wait-offload)。"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "`/admin/routewise/model-settings`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "Per-model RouteWise tuning — see [RouteWise](#routewise)."
msgstr "按模型的 RouteWise 调参——见 [RouteWise](#routewise)。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:628
msgid ""
"Each `POST` or `PUT` that changes a route has a `...-verifications` twin "
"that tries the upstream without saving. A save tries it the same way "
"before it writes anything, and the audit log records each check as "
"`routing.provider_routes.verify`, a failed one too."
msgstr ""
"每个修改路由的 `POST` 或 `PUT` 都有一个 `...-verifications` "
"孪生端点，只测试上游而不保存。保存时也会在写入任何内容之前以同样的方式测试上游；审计日志把每次测试都记为 "
"`routing.provider_routes.verify`，失败的测试也会记录。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:633
msgid ""
"A check sends the provider's stored API keys to the route's base URL. "
"Verify sends them only to the provider's own host or a host its routes "
"already use. A save that would send them to any other host answers `403` "
"with `error_code` `ADMIN_CONFIRMATION_REQUIRED` until the body carries "
"the signed-in administrator's `password`, or `\"\"` when the account "
"confirms with an authenticator code or a fresh single sign-on instead; "
"the console asks for it. `ADMIN_TOKEN` cannot confirm, so it cannot point"
" a route at such a host."
msgstr ""
"测试会把提供方保存的 API 密钥发送到路由的 base URL。Verify "
"只会把密钥发送到提供方自己的主机，或其路由已在使用的主机。如果保存会把密钥发送到其他主机，接口会返回 `403`，`error_code` 为 "
"`ADMIN_CONFIRMATION_REQUIRED`，直到请求体带上已登录管理员的 `password`；账号用身份验证器验证码或新的单点登录确认时，则带上 "
"`\"\"`。控制台会提示管理员确认。`ADMIN_TOKEN` 无法确认，因此不能把路由指向这样的主机。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:641
msgid ""
"See [Runtime configuration from the admin console](configuration.md"
"#runtime-configuration-from-the-admin-console) for the console tabs "
"behind these endpoints."
msgstr ""
"这些端点对应的控制台标签页，见[在管理控制台中做运行时配置](configuration.md#runtime-"
"configuration-from-the-admin-console)。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:633
msgid "Where the code lives"
msgstr "代码在哪里"

#: ../developer/routing.md:635
msgid "Four pieces, all under `apps/backend/routing/`:"
msgstr "共四个部分，全部位于 `apps/backend/routing/` 下："

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "Layer"
msgstr "层"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "Code"
msgstr "代码"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "Responsibility"
msgstr "职责"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "Deployment-wide weight strategy"
msgstr "部署级权重策略"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "`manager.py` + `strategies/weight.py`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid ""
"Reads the routing file and rewrites each model's per-route weights from a"
" local/remote split. Optional."
msgstr "读取路由配置文件，按本地/远端的分流比例重写每个模型各条路由的权重。可选。"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "Per-model router selection"
msgstr "按模型选择 router"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "`model_router_registry.py` + `strategies/__init__.py`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid ""
"Maps each model id to a `RouterProtocol` implementation, chosen by that "
"model's `router:` field."
msgstr "把每个模型 id 映射到一个 `RouterProtocol` 实现，由该模型的 `router:` 字段决定选哪个。"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "`routers.py` (`FixedRouter`), `routewise/`, `hybrid.py` (`HybridRouter`)"
msgstr "`routers.py`（`FixedRouter`）、`routewise/`、`hybrid.py`（`HybridRouter`）"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid ""
"Chooses the endpoint for a request, admits it against capacity, walks the"
" fallback order, and records endpoint health."
msgstr "为请求选定端点，按容量做准入，按回退顺序逐个尝试，并记录端点健康状况。"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "Execution"
msgstr "执行"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid ""
"`backends.py` (public re-exports), `backends_contract.py`, "
"`backends_leaf.py`, `backends_tree.py`, `backends_domains.py`, "
"`backends_routewise.py` + `dispatch.py`"
msgstr ""
"`backends.py`（公共重导出）、`backends_contract.py`、`backends_leaf.py`、`backends_tree.py`、`backends_domains.py`、`backends_routewise.py`"
" + `dispatch.py`"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid ""
"Runs the one endpoint the router already chose, or delegates the request "
"to a pool that chooses inside its own declared range."
msgstr "调用 router 已经选定的那个端点，或者把请求交给一个池，由池在自己声明的范围内选择。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:644
msgid "Router types and execution boundaries"
msgstr "router 类型与执行边界"

#: ../developer/routing.md:646
msgid ""
"At startup, `apps/backend/serving/servers/bootstrap.py` registers the "
"catalog into one shared `FixedRouter`, applies the optional "
"`RoutingManager`, and builds a `ModelRouterRegistry` over the same route "
"table. It builds every model's router at boot, so a bad strategy name or "
"`router_params:` fails at startup. The current design is in the "
"[composable routing design "
"record](https://github.com/HarvardMadSys/hybridInference/blob/dev/docs/agents/specs/2026-09-14"
"-composable-hybrid-routing-design.zh.md)."
msgstr ""
"启动时，`apps/backend/serving/servers/bootstrap.py` 把目录注册到一个共享的 `FixedRouter`"
" 中，应用可选的 `RoutingManager`，再在同一张路由表上构建 `ModelRouterRegistry`。它在启动时就构建每个模型的"
" router，所以错误的策略名或 `router_params:` "
"会在启动时报错。当前的设计见[可组合路由设计记录](https://github.com/HarvardMadSys/hybridInference/blob/dev/docs/agents/specs/2026-09-14"
"-composable-hybrid-routing-design.zh.md)。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:653
msgid ""
"![FixedRouter, RouteWiseRouter and HybridRouter implement RouterProtocol."
" Fixed and RouteWise execute a chosen endpoint through LeafBackend, which"
" calls one Adapter. HybridRouter selects no endpoint of its own and "
"delegates to the RoutingBackend pool contract, which TreeBackend "
"implements by holding a scoped router. GreedyRouter and NimbusRouter are "
"dashed because they do not exist yet.](images/routing-contracts.svg)"
msgstr ""
"![FixedRouter、RouteWiseRouter 和 HybridRouter 实现 RouterProtocol。Fixed 和 "
"RouteWise 通过 LeafBackend 执行选中的端点，LeafBackend 调用一个 Adapter。HybridRouter "
"自己不选择端点，而是委托给 RoutingBackend 池契约，TreeBackend 通过持有一个限定范围的 router "
"来实现这个契约。GreedyRouter 和 NimbusRouter 用虚线表示，因为它们还不存在。](images/routing-"
"contracts.svg)"

#: ../developer/routing.md:653
msgid ""
"FixedRouter, RouteWiseRouter and HybridRouter implement RouterProtocol. "
"Fixed and RouteWise execute a chosen endpoint through LeafBackend, which "
"calls one Adapter. HybridRouter selects no endpoint of its own and "
"delegates to the RoutingBackend pool contract, which TreeBackend "
"implements by holding a scoped router. GreedyRouter and NimbusRouter are "
"dashed because they do not exist yet."
msgstr ""
"FixedRouter、RouteWiseRouter 和 HybridRouter 实现 RouterProtocol。Fixed 和 "
"RouteWise 通过 LeafBackend 执行选中的端点，LeafBackend 调用一个 Adapter。HybridRouter "
"自己不选择端点，而是委托给 RoutingBackend 池契约，TreeBackend 通过持有一个限定范围的 router "
"来实现这个契约。GreedyRouter 和 NimbusRouter 用虚线表示，因为它们还不存在。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:655
msgid "*Router contracts. Dashed boxes and edges are not built yet.*"
msgstr "*router 契约。虚线框和虚线边表示尚未实现的部分。*"

#: ../developer/routing.md:657
msgid ""
"`FixedRouter` and `RouteWiseRouter` are peer implementations of "
"`RouterProtocol`, and future Greedy or Nimbus routers belong beside them."
" Each owns its own selection, admission, retries and feedback. Once a "
"router picks an endpoint, it executes it through a `LeafBackend`, which "
"calls that one adapter with the adapter's own signature. `HybridRouter` "
"selects nothing itself: it hands each attempt to a pool, a `TreeBackend` "
"that holds a scoped router (which can be RouteWise)."
msgstr ""
"`FixedRouter` 和 `RouteWiseRouter` 是 `RouterProtocol` 的平级实现，未来的 Greedy 或 "
"Nimbus router 也属于这一层。每个 router 都自己负责选路、准入、重试和反馈。router 选定端点后，通过 "
"`LeafBackend` 执行它，后者以 adapter 自己的调用签名调用这一个 adapter。`HybridRouter` "
"自己什么都不选：它把每次尝试交给一个池，即持有一个限定范围 router（可以是 RouteWise）的 `TreeBackend`。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:665
msgid "Leaves, pools, and dispatch instructions"
msgstr "叶子、池与分派指令"

#: ../developer/routing.md:667
msgid ""
"A router binds its choice in an `EndpointBinding`: the endpoint id, "
"model, pool, a diagnostic `generation` and the adapter itself. Execution "
"never looks the target up again, so an admin route edit cannot redirect a"
" request in flight. Each hedge leg gets its own leaf, and RouteWise "
"refuses a binding whose adapter has been replaced before it reserves "
"capacity."
msgstr ""
"router 把它的选择绑定在一个 `EndpointBinding` 中：端点 id、模型、池、一个用于诊断的 `generation`，以及 "
"adapter 本身。执行时不会再查找一次目标，所以管理员修改路由不会改变正在进行的请求的去向。每条对冲分支都有自己的叶子；如果某个 "
"binding 的 adapter 已被替换，RouteWise 会在预留容量之前拒绝它。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:673
msgid ""
"The router that chose the endpoint keeps all accounting: the admission "
"claim, the prefill lease, retry and hedge bookkeeping, `_routing` "
"metadata and the feedback to `record_observation()`. A leaf keeps no "
"second copy."
msgstr ""
"选定端点的 router 保留全部记账：准入 claim、prefill 租约、重试和对冲的记录、`_routing` 元数据，以及交给 "
"`record_observation()` 的反馈。叶子不保留第二份副本。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:677
msgid "A pool takes one of two instructions (`apps/backend/routing/dispatch.py`):"
msgstr "池接受两种指令之一（`apps/backend/routing/dispatch.py`）："

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "Instruction"
msgstr "指令"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "Permission"
msgstr "权限"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "Pool behavior"
msgstr "池的行为"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "`ExecuteEndpoint(binding)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "Execute exactly the bound endpoint."
msgstr "只执行绑定的那个端点。"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid ""
"`TreeBackend` accepts a binding within its model and endpoint scope. The "
"child router admits that target and executes it through a leaf, with re-"
"selection and fallback disabled."
msgstr "`TreeBackend` 接受其模型和端点范围内的 binding。子 router 准入该目标，并通过叶子执行它，同时关闭重新选择和回退。"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "`DelegatePool(pool_id)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid "Select inside the named pool."
msgstr "在指定的池内选择。"

#: ../developer/routing.md
msgid ""
"`TreeBackend` delegates selection, admission, retries, and hedging to its"
" scoped router."
msgstr "`TreeBackend` 把选路、准入、重试和对冲委托给它限定范围的 router。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:684
msgid ""
"`check_dispatch()` refuses a wrong pool, an excluded model or an out-of-"
"scope binding before any upstream I/O, as a composition error: no "
"fallback and no provider failure. A leaf cannot carry out `DelegatePool`."
" `LocalBackend` and `FixedCloudBackend` narrow "
"`RoutingRequestOptions.endpoint_scope` before calling the shared router, "
"and `RouteWiseCloudBackend` binds a `RouteScopeView` (`route_scope.py`) "
"that keeps the child's selection, retries, hedges and probes in range. An"
" empty scope intersection is refused, never treated as unrestricted. A "
"pool with no capacity raises `TargetUnavailableError`, and `HybridRouter`"
" tries the next attempt; if every attempt is refused before reaching an "
"upstream, the request gets 503 (as an SSE error once headers are sent)."
msgstr ""
"`check_dispatch()` 会在任何上游 I/O 之前拒绝错误的池、被排除的模型或超出范围的 "
"binding，作为组合错误处理：不回退，也不记为 provider 失败。叶子无法执行 "
"`DelegatePool`。`LocalBackend` 和 `FixedCloudBackend` 在调用共享 router 之前收窄 "
"`RoutingRequestOptions.endpoint_scope`，`RouteWiseCloudBackend` 则绑定一个 "
"`RouteScopeView`（`route_scope.py`），让子 router "
"的选路、重试、对冲和探测都留在范围内。范围交集为空时会被拒绝，绝不会被当成不受限制。没有容量的池会抛出 "
"`TargetUnavailableError`，`HybridRouter` 随即尝试下一次；如果每次尝试都在到达上游之前被拒绝，请求得到 "
"503（响应头已发送时以 SSE 错误的形式返回）。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:696
msgid "Hybrid composition"
msgstr "混合组合"

#: ../developer/routing.md:698
msgid ""
"The hybrid composition is an opt-in, experimental `HybridRouter` for a "
"`fixed` model with both local and cloud candidates:"
msgstr "混合组合是一个需要显式开启的实验性 `HybridRouter`，用于同时拥有本地和云端候选的 `fixed` 模型："

#: ../developer/routing.md:707
msgid ""
"Without both kinds of candidate the model keeps the shared `FixedRouter`,"
" and pinned requests (`X-Route-Pin`, the admin playground) always use it."
" Local means what outbound admission means: a route's `deployment_type`, "
"or its hostname under `auto`. A composition root can instead pass "
"`local_scope` or `local_ownership` to "
"`apps/backend/serving/servers/hybrid_composition.py`."
msgstr ""
"如果不同时具备这两类候选，模型继续使用共享的 `FixedRouter`；固定到某条路由的请求（`X-Route-Pin`、管理员 "
"playground）也总是使用它。“本地”的含义与出站准入相同：由路由的 `deployment_type` 决定，`auto` "
"时由主机名决定。组合根也可以改为向 `apps/backend/serving/servers/hybrid_composition.py` 传入"
" `local_scope` 或 `local_ownership`。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:713
msgid ""
"![HybridRouter and FixedPolicy dispatch through LocalBackend or "
"FixedCloudBackend. Both scoped TreeBackend wrappers hold one shared "
"FixedRouter, which executes the selected endpoint through its own "
"LeafBackend and Adapter.](images/routing-fixed-composition.svg)"
msgstr ""
"![HybridRouter 和 FixedPolicy 通过 LocalBackend 或 FixedCloudBackend "
"分派。这两个限定范围的 TreeBackend 包装器持有同一个共享的 FixedRouter，由它通过自己的 LeafBackend 和 "
"Adapter 执行选中的端点。](images/routing-fixed-composition.svg)"

#: ../developer/routing.md:713
msgid ""
"HybridRouter and FixedPolicy dispatch through LocalBackend or "
"FixedCloudBackend. Both scoped TreeBackend wrappers hold one shared "
"FixedRouter, which executes the selected endpoint through its own "
"LeafBackend and Adapter."
msgstr ""
"HybridRouter 和 FixedPolicy 通过 LocalBackend 或 FixedCloudBackend "
"分派。这两个限定范围的 TreeBackend 包装器持有同一个共享的 FixedRouter，由它通过自己的 LeafBackend 和 "
"Adapter 执行选中的端点。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:715
msgid "*Fixed composition: two scoped pools, one shared FixedRouter.*"
msgstr "*Fixed 组合：两个限定范围的池，一个共享的 FixedRouter。*"

#: ../developer/routing.md:717
msgid ""
"`HybridRouter` plans attempts with `FixedPolicy`. The primary attempt is "
"a `DelegatePool`, so the pool may choose inside its scope; every planned "
"fallback is an `ExecuteEndpoint`, so the child router cannot reorder the "
"plan. The composition is not the default because its affinity updates, "
"its re-selection after a refused primary claim and its fallback circuit "
"timing are not yet proven equivalent to `FixedRouter` "
"([#1457](https://github.com/HarvardMadSys/hybridInference/issues/1457))."
msgstr ""
"`HybridRouter` 用 `FixedPolicy` 规划尝试。主尝试是 "
"`DelegatePool`，所以池可以在自己的范围内选择；每个计划好的回退都是 `ExecuteEndpoint`，所以子 router "
"无法打乱计划。这种组合不是默认行为，因为它的亲和更新、主 claim 被拒后的重新选择以及回退的熔断时机，尚未被证明与 `FixedRouter`"
" "
"等价（[#1457](https://github.com/HarvardMadSys/hybridInference/issues/1457)）。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:725
msgid ""
"A planned extension puts a Greedy router in front, owning local "
"admission, with a cloud-scoped RouteWise under a `TreeBackend` choosing "
"among cloud endpoints. The pool side exists (`backends_tree.py`, and the "
"transitional `RouteWiseCloudBackend` in `backends_routewise.py`), and "
"`HybridFixedRouterFactory` accepts a `cloud_backend` builder, but no "
"configuration reaches it: `GreedyRouter` and `NimbusRouter` are not "
"registered. Separate scopes do not divide physical capacity; sharing "
"quota or concurrency across router instances is not implemented (#1457)."
msgstr ""
"一个计划中的扩展是在前面放一个负责本地准入的 Greedy router，再在 `TreeBackend` 下放一个限定于云端的 "
"RouteWise，在云端端点之间选择。池这一侧已经存在（`backends_tree.py`，以及 "
"`backends_routewise.py` 中过渡用的 "
"`RouteWiseCloudBackend`），`HybridFixedRouterFactory` 也接受 `cloud_backend` "
"构建器，但任何配置都到达不了这种形态：`GreedyRouter` 和 `NimbusRouter` "
"都没有注册。不同的范围并不会划分物理容量；在多个 router 实例之间共享配额或并发尚未实现（#1457）。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:734
msgid "Adding a routing strategy"
msgstr "添加路由策略"

#: ../developer/routing.md:736
msgid ""
"A strategy is a class that satisfies `RouterProtocol`, registered under a"
" name a model's `router:` field can select."
msgstr "路由策略是一个满足 `RouterProtocol` 的类，以模型的 `router:` 字段可以选择的名称注册。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:739
msgid "1. Understand the contract"
msgstr "1\\. 理解这份契约"

#: ../developer/routing.md:741
msgid ""
"`RouterProtocol` (`apps/backend/routing/protocols.py`) is a runtime-"
"checkable `Protocol` with four members:"
msgstr ""
"`RouterProtocol`（`apps/backend/routing/protocols.py`）是一个可在运行时检查的 "
"`Protocol`，有四个成员："

#: ../developer/routing.md:768
msgid ""
"`RoutingRequestOptions` carries router-owned controls that must never "
"reach a provider adapter: `pin_provider` (a hard pin that disables "
"fallback), `preferred_endpoint_id` (mandatory only with "
"`require_target`), `endpoint_scope`, `allow_fallback`, `bound_endpoint`, "
"`required_modalities` and `affinity` (whether to follow and update the "
"caller's pin)."
msgstr ""
"`RoutingRequestOptions` 携带由 router 掌握、绝不能传给 provider adapter "
"的控制项：`pin_provider`（硬性固定，会关闭回退）、`preferred_endpoint_id`（只有配合 "
"`require_target` "
"时才是强制的）、`endpoint_scope`、`allow_fallback`、`bound_endpoint`、`required_modalities`"
" 和 `affinity`（是否遵循并更新调用方的亲和绑定）。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:774
msgid ""
"`RoutingObservation` (`routers.py`) reports a completed request: endpoint"
" id, TTFT, total latency, token counts, success, `status_code` for a "
"failure, `uncharged` for a failure no endpoint is charged with, and the "
"`strategy_metadata` the strategy filled in. A stateless strategy ignores "
"it. A learning one should take only what the attempt shows about its "
"endpoint, as RouteWise does: it measures time to first content from the "
"attempt's own dispatch, ignores total latency, and leaves client errors "
"(a 4xx other than 408, 429, 401 and 407) and uncharged failures out of "
"its latency profiles. An uncharged failure means the gateway refused the "
"attempt before sending it, so RouteWise re-solves over the other "
"candidates."
msgstr ""
"`RoutingObservation`（`routers.py`）报告一次已完成的请求：端点 id、TTFT、总延迟、token "
"数、是否成功、失败时的 `status_code`、表示失败不归咎于任何端点的 `uncharged`，以及策略自己填写的 "
"`strategy_metadata`。无状态的策略可以忽略它。会学习的策略应该只采纳这次尝试反映出的端点信息，RouteWise "
"就是这样做的：它从这次尝试自己的分派时刻开始测量首个内容的时间，忽略总延迟，并把客户端错误（408、429、401 和 407 以外的 4xx）和"
" uncharged 失败排除在延迟画像之外。uncharged 失败表示网关在发出之前就拒绝了这次尝试，所以 RouteWise "
"会在其他候选上重新求解。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:785
msgid "Two optional capabilities:"
msgstr "另有两项可选能力："

#: ../developer/routing.md:787
msgid ""
"`RouteTableRefreshable`: implement `refresh_route_table()` if your router"
" derives state from the route table; "
"`ModelRouterRegistry.refresh_route_tables()` calls it after an admin "
"route change."
msgstr ""
"`RouteTableRefreshable`：如果你的 router 从路由表派生状态，就实现 "
"`refresh_route_table()`；管理员修改路由后，`ModelRouterRegistry.refresh_route_tables()`"
" 会调用它。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:790
msgid ""
"`ManagedRouter` (`routers.py`): implement `async start()` / `async "
"stop()` if your router owns background tasks. Bootstrap drives their "
"lifecycle."
msgstr ""
"`ManagedRouter`（`routers.py`）：如果你的 router 有后台任务，就实现 `async start()` / "
"`async stop()`。启动流程会负责它们的生命周期。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:793
msgid "2. Get the routes"
msgstr "2\\. 拿到路由"

#: ../developer/routing.md:795
msgid ""
"The registry builds your router, then calls "
"`attach_route_table(route_table)` on it. A router without that method "
"sees no routes at all. The object satisfies `RouteTableView` "
"(`apps/backend/routing/route_table.py`):"
msgstr ""
"registry 构建你的 router 之后，会调用它的 `attach_route_table(route_table)`。没有这个方法的 "
"router 看不到任何路由。传入的对象满足 "
"`RouteTableView`（`apps/backend/routing/route_table.py`）："

#: ../developer/routing.md:804
msgid ""
"Each `EffectiveRoute` is a frozen `(route_key, canonical_model_id, "
"adapters)` triple, where `adapters` holds `(adapter, weight)` pairs with "
"weight overrides and provider disables applied. Snapshot it; do not hold "
"a lock across a dispatch."
msgstr ""
"每个 `EffectiveRoute` 是一个不可变的 `(route_key, canonical_model_id, adapters)` "
"三元组，其中 `adapters` 是已经应用了权重覆盖和 provider 禁用的 `(adapter, weight)` "
"对。请先做快照；不要在分派期间持有锁。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:809
msgid "3. Write the strategy module"
msgstr "3\\. 写策略模块"

#: ../developer/routing.md:811
msgid ""
"Strategies live in `apps/backend/routing/strategies/`, one module each, "
"exporting a router class and a Pydantic params model. A complete round-"
"robin strategy, saved as "
"`apps/backend/routing/strategies/round_robin.py`:"
msgstr ""
"路由策略放在 `apps/backend/routing/strategies/` 中，每个策略一个模块，导出一个 router 类和一个 "
"Pydantic 参数模型。下面是一个完整的轮询策略，保存为 "
"`apps/backend/routing/strategies/round_robin.py`："

#: ../developer/routing.md:968
msgid "Points to copy:"
msgstr "值得照搬的要点："

#: ../developer/routing.md:970
msgid ""
"**`extra=\"forbid\"` on the params model**, so a typo in `router_params:`"
" fails at boot instead of silently using a default."
msgstr ""
"**在参数模型上设置 `extra=\"forbid\"`**，这样 `router_params:` "
"中的拼写错误会在启动时报错，而不是悄悄使用默认值。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:972
msgid ""
"**Accept `health_registry=`** (or `**kwargs`). The registry requires it "
"when it passes `RouterBuildDependencies` and raises `TypeError` "
"otherwise; sharing the process registry makes one endpoint's circuit "
"visible to every router."
msgstr ""
"**接受 `health_registry=`**（或 `**kwargs`）。registry 传入 "
"`RouterBuildDependencies` 时要求有这个参数，否则抛出 `TypeError`；共享进程级的 registry "
"能让一个端点的熔断状态对所有 router 可见。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:975
msgid ""
"**Name the first parameter `params`.** `build_router` calls "
"`router_cls(params=validated, ...)`."
msgstr ""
"**第一个参数命名为 `params`**。`build_router` 调用的是 `router_cls(params=validated, "
"...)`。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:977
msgid ""
"**Use `endpoint_id_for_adapter`.** Endpoint ids key health, latency "
"profiling and log attribution; your own would split them."
msgstr "**使用 `endpoint_id_for_adapter`**。端点 id 是健康状态、延迟画像和日志归属的键；自己另造一套会把它们拆散。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:979
msgid ""
"**Execute through a leaf.** Bind with `binding_for_adapter()`, build the "
"leaf with `LeafBackend.for_binding()` and call it with the adapter's "
"arguments, keeping admission, health and `_routing` metadata in your "
"router. When delegating to a pool, send `ExecuteEndpoint` only for an "
"exact target you resolved, else `DelegatePool`, and pass the binding and "
"target/fallback controls in `RoutingRequestOptions`."
msgstr ""
"**通过叶子执行**。用 `binding_for_adapter()` 绑定，用 `LeafBackend.for_binding()` "
"构建叶子，再以 adapter 的参数调用它，同时把准入、健康状态和 `_routing` 元数据留在你的 router "
"中。委托给池时，只有已经解析出确切目标时才发送 `ExecuteEndpoint`，否则发送 `DelegatePool`，并通过 "
"`RoutingRequestOptions` 传递 binding 以及目标和回退控制项。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:986
msgid "4. Register it at import time"
msgstr "4\\. 在导入时注册它"

#: ../developer/routing.md:988
msgid ""
"Registration is an import side effect. Import the module at the *bottom* "
"of `apps/backend/routing/strategies/__init__.py`, beside the existing "
"imports; strategy modules import `routing.routers` at their top, so a "
"top-of-file import here would be a cycle:"
msgstr ""
"注册是导入时的副作用。在 `apps/backend/routing/strategies/__init__.py` "
"的*底部*、现有导入语句旁边导入这个模块；策略模块在顶部导入了 `routing.routers`，所以在这里的文件顶部导入会造成循环："

#: ../developer/routing.md:998
msgid ""
"If your strategy needs an optional package, guard the import and call "
"`register_missing_strategy(name, reason)` in the `except ImportError:` "
"branch, as `routewise` does. Selecting it then fails configuration "
"validation with your message instead of breaking backend import."
msgstr ""
"如果你的策略依赖一个可选的包，请把导入放进保护块，并在 `except ImportError:` 分支中调用 "
"`register_missing_strategy(name, reason)`，`routewise` "
"就是这样做的。这样，选择它时会在配置校验阶段报出你的消息，而不会让后端导入失败。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:1003
msgid "5. Select it"
msgstr "5\\. 选用它"

#: ../developer/routing.md:1005
msgid "Per model, in the model registry:"
msgstr "按模型来，写在模型注册表里："

#: ../developer/routing.md:1021
msgid "Or deployment-wide, in the routing file:"
msgstr "或者按部署来，写在路由配置文件里："

#: ../developer/routing.md:1029
msgid ""
"`RoutingManager.apply()` rewrites weights only when the effective "
"`default_router` is `fixed`; otherwise each model's `route:` weights stay"
" as written."
msgstr ""
"只有当实际生效的 `default_router` 是 `fixed` 时，`RoutingManager.apply()` "
"才会改写权重；否则每个模型的 `route:` 权重保持原样。"

#: ../developer/routing.md:1033
msgid "6. Test it"
msgstr "6\\. 测试它"

#: ../developer/routing.md:1035
msgid ""
"Add your class to `tests/unit/routing/test_router_contract.py`, the "
"contract every serving router must satisfy; `test_strategies.py` covers "
"registration, params validation and the dependency check. "
"`isinstance(router, RouterProtocol)` works because the protocol is "
"`@runtime_checkable`."
msgstr ""
"把你的类加到 `tests/unit/routing/test_router_contract.py` 中，这是每个服务用 router "
"都必须满足的契约；`test_strategies.py` 覆盖注册、参数校验和依赖检查。由于这个协议是 "
"`@runtime_checkable`，`isinstance(router, RouterProtocol)` 是有效的。"

